{"parse": {"title": "■■■■■■■■", "pageid": 135999, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"■■■■■■■■\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/98/Item-221262.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"■■■■■■■■\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>■■■■■■■■</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#221262</div></div><hr /><div>收录了一段回忆的磁记录媒介。《■■■■■■■■》已经添加至氛围制造机。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">漆黑之中的色彩，远隔千里的触感，无须入口便可品味的芬芳皆在此处。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">氛围制造机</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><div><img alt=\"Bgmtoggle infoicon.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/20px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"image-negative\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/30px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/40px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" />介绍：060E020D0F1B09000404005C5C<br /><img alt=\"Bgmtoggle chaticon.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/20px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"image-negative\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/30px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/40px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E2%96%A0%E2%96%A0%E2%96%A0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"■■■（页面不存在）\">■■■</a>的评论：6861766566756E</div></div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>对于评论中的密语：<code>6861766566756E</code>，解为ASCII码后可得<code>havefun</code><span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（玩的愉快）</span>。</li>\n<li>对于介绍中的密语，再对照使用两次评论中的密语：</li></ul>\n<p><code style=\"display:block; width:fit-content; text-indent:0; margin-left:2em;\">\n06 0E 02 0D 0F 1B 09 00 04 04 00 5C 5C<br />\n68 61 76 65 66 75 6E 68 61 76 65 66 75</code>\n</p>\n<p>对两组异或运算，再解为ASCII码：</p>\n<p><code style=\"display:block; width:fit-content; text-indent:0; margin-left:2em; white-space:pre;\">6E 6F 74 68 69 6E 67 68 65 72 65 3A 29<br />n  o  t  h  i  n  g  h  e  r  e &#160;:  )</code>\n</p>\n<p>即：<code>nothinghere:)</code><span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（什么也没有:) ）</span>。</p></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "■■■■■■■■"}}